(6963492, 1050489, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp, bright light. I like the texture on the snow at the street side. I am noticing the electric poles and the roofline of the house in the background has some very strange outline around them. I an not sure what this phenomenon is...</td>', 'Nice and crisp, bright light. I like the texture on the snow at the street side. I am noticing the electric poles and the roofline of the house in the background has some very strange outline around them. I an not sure what this phenomenon is...', '2013-01-23 19:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6963494, 1050569, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice angle on this great American Muscle car. I am seeing some very wierd green fringe on various places in this shot. The trees, under the license plate, on the corner of the bumper, the top of the windshield, in the shadow on the left under the car and along the curb. If it was just in the trees, I could say it was chromatic aberation, but it''s everywhere. Is this a result of you desaturating and changing the tone on one of the color channels? Yellow Channel perhaps?</td>', 'Nice angle on this great American Muscle car. I am seeing some very wierd green fringe on various places in this shot. The trees, under the license plate, on the corner of the bumper, the top of the windshield, in the shadow on the left under the car and along the curb. If it was just in the trees, I could say it was chromatic aberation, but it''s everywhere. Is this a result of you desaturating and changing the tone on one of the color channels? Yellow Channel perhaps?', '2013-01-23 19:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6963495, 1050446, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean!</td>', 'Nice and clean!', '2013-01-23 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
