(6964386, 1050422, 59029, '<td valign="top">I thought it meant beware, cows may be about to mate with sheep!</td>', 'I thought it meant beware, cows may be about to mate with sheep!', '2013-01-25 11:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6964431, 1050381, 140305, '<td valign="top">Too bad they weren''t looking in your direction, although perhaps they were posing for someone else :)<br/>This reminds me of when I was a kid and my parents would pack us all up (7 children) and go camping to Jasper, Alberta. My dad would always try to find us some sheep to watch, and he was usually pretty successful. This brings back fond memories! As far as the sign is concerned, I''m just enjoying the rest of the image so much I almost wish it weren''t there - and therein lies the challenge. Hope that makes some sense. Still, I''m giving this a 7.</td>', 'Too bad they weren''t looking in your direction, although perhaps they were posing for someone else :)This reminds me of when I was a kid and my parents would pack us all up (7 children) and go camping to Jasper, Alberta. My dad would always try to find us some sheep to watch, and he was usually pretty successful. This brings back fond memories! As far as the sign is concerned, I''m just enjoying the rest of the image so much I almost wish it weren''t there - and therein lies the challenge. Hope that makes some sense. Still, I''m giving this a 7.', '2013-01-25 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
